# Migration skill auto-invoke (project-saral)

User က skill/path name မပြောဘဲ prompt intent မှ **Read** လုပ် — implement မတိုင်မီ skip မလုပ်။

## Baseline / bulk (Wave 0–3)

**Triggers (EN/MM):** bulk, baseline, scaffold, wire, wired, တန်းပြောင်း, အားလုံး, all pages, all web parts, 4 web part, re-scaffold, inventory sync, baseline wave

1. Read `.cursor/skills/bulk-classic-to-spfx-baseline/SKILL.md`
2. Sync `docs/migration/PARITY.md` ↔ repo-root `progress.md`
3. Scope = **multiple live routes** OK in one wave
4. Status = **wired / baseline** only — **no parity PASS** claim
5. Rule `18-bulk-migration-baseline.mdc` constraints apply

## Parity / visual (Wave 4 · one slice)

**Triggers:** parity, visual, pixel, classic match, classic နဲ့, spacing, hover, font, breakpoint, visual QA, parity PASS

1. Read `.cursor/skills/classic-to-spfx-migration/SKILL.md`
2. Then `classic-visual-parity` → `uikit-to-spfx-visual-parity` (UI tasks)
3. Scope = **one web part / one classic page** — bulk parity reject
4. Status = **parity PASS** only after visual checklist

## SPFx scaffold / data (any migration)

**Triggers:** web part, SPFx, gulp, manifest, serve.json, list, PnP, SPHttpClient

→ Read `.cursor/skills/spfx/SKILL.md` (+ `references/` only if needed)

## Ambiguous

**Examples:** "spfx ပြောင်းပေး", "migrate classic", "classic → SPFx" (mode unclear)

→ Clarify-first **one question:** baseline bulk (wire all) vs parity slice (one WP polish)?  
→ User confirms → load matching skill above. Do not guess parity vs baseline.

## Always (migration)

- `.cursor/rules/17-classic-host-and-assets.mdc` — one WP per classic page; **no hub pageKey router**
- Pins: SPFx 1.20 · gulp · React 17 · Fluent v8 · no Heft/v9 · deps ask-first

## Reject routing to

- `mk/.cursor/` or skill `classic-spfx-migration` (hub playbook — wrong for this repo)
- parity PASS during baseline triggers
- Entire-site parity PASS in one turn
